#ASSERT `Am I deemed to have a serious injury under s 135A` FALSE (`d` 15 8 2000) FALSE (`d` 1 1 2000) (`d` 14 3 2001) 0 EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Received 10 August 2000 (not "after 10 August"): 120 days, to 8 December 2000.
#ASSERT `Am I deemed to have a serious injury under s 135A` FALSE (`d` 10 8 2000) FALSE (`d` 1 1 2000) (`d` 8 12 2000) 0 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Am I deemed to have a serious injury under s 135A` FALSE (`d` 10 8 2000) FALSE (`d` 1 1 2000) (`d` 9 12 2000) 0 EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Leave under s 135A(4)(b): 30 plain days.
#ASSERT `By when must I apply for leave to sue under s 135A` (`d` 1 3 2026) EQUALS `d` 31 3 2026
#ASSERT `By when must I apply for leave to sue under s 135A` (`d` 10 12 2026) EQUALS `d` 9 1 2027

