§§ `s 134AB(25), (26) -- the reductions`

-- ($500,000 - $120,000 + $300,000 - $50,000) x 80% = $504,000.
#ASSERT `How much will my damages judgment be after the reductions` 500000 300000 120000 50000 20 EQUALS 504000
-- Compensation paid exceeds the pecuniary damages: nothing for that head.
#ASSERT `How much will my damages judgment be after the reductions` 100000 0 150000 0 0 EQUALS 0

§§ `s 134AB(28), (28A), s 135A(13A) -- costs`

-- Arguments: liability established, amount, statutory offer, counter offer.
#ASSERT `Who pays the costs of my damages proceedings` FALSE 0 300000 500000 EQUALS `I pay both sides' costs`
#ASSERT `Who pays the costs of my damages proceedings` TRUE 300000 300000 500000 EQUALS `I pay both sides' costs`
#ASSERT `Who pays the costs of my damages proceedings` TRUE 300001 300000 500000 EQUALS `each side bears its own costs`
#ASSERT `Who pays the costs of my damages proceedings` TRUE 449999 300000 500000 EQUALS `each side bears its own costs`
#ASSERT `Who pays the costs of my damages proceedings` TRUE 450000 300000 500000 EQUALS `the Authority or self-insurer pays both sides' costs`
-- s 134AB(28A): ($600,000 - $100,000) x 90% = $450,000.
#ASSERT `What amount is compared with the offers for costs` 600000 100000 10 EQUALS 450000

§§ `Discount rate, and what damages do to compensation`

#ASSERT `What discount rate applies to my future loss` `section 134AB` EQUALS 6
#ASSERT `What discount rate applies to my future loss` `section 135A` EQUALS 3
-- Arguments: pecuniary damages awarded, still receiving, sole defendant the employer, payment issued.
#ASSERT `Do my weekly payments stop after my damages` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `my weekly payments are not affected`
#ASSERT `Do my weekly payments stop after my damages` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `a weekly amount continues until payment of the judgment is issued, then stops`
#ASSERT `Do my weekly payments stop after my damages` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS `my weekly payments stop`
#ASSERT `Do my weekly payments stop after my damages` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `my weekly payments stop`
#ASSERT `Do my weekly payments stop after my damages` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `my weekly payments stop`
#ASSERT `Do my impairment payments stop after my damages` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Do my impairment payments stop after my damages` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
